  { id: 'm581', question: 'Calculate: (−16) + 13', answer: '-3', unit: '', explanation: '符号のちがう数の足し算は、絶対値の大きいほうから小さいほうを引き、大きいほうの符号をつける。答えは -3。', level: 4, category: '正負の数' },
  { id: 'm582', question: 'Calculate: 5 − (−12)', answer: '17', unit: '', explanation: '負の数を引くのは足すのと同じ。5 + 12 = 17。', level: 4, category: '正負の数' },
  { id: 'm583', question: 'Calculate: (−3) × (−6)', answer: '18', unit: '', explanation: '負 × 負 は正。3 × 6 = 18。', level: 4, category: '正負の数' },
  { id: 'm584', question: 'Calculate: (−20) ÷ 4', answer: '-5', unit: '', explanation: '負 ÷ 正 は負。20 ÷ 4 = 5 なので、答えは −5。', level: 4, category: '正負の数' },
  { id: 'm585', question: 'Calculate: (−4)²', answer: '16', unit: '', explanation: '(−4)² は (−4) × (−4)。負 × 負 は正なので 16。−4² との違いに注意。', level: 4, category: '正負の数' },
  { id: 'm586', question: 'Calculate: (−4) + 16', answer: '12', unit: '', explanation: '符号のちがう数の足し算は、絶対値の大きいほうから小さいほうを引き、大きいほうの符号をつける。答えは 12。', level: 4, category: '正負の数' },
  { id: 'm587', question: 'Calculate: 9 − (−17)', answer: '26', unit: '', explanation: '負の数を引くのは足すのと同じ。9 + 17 = 26。', level: 4, category: '正負の数' },
  { id: 'm588', question: 'Calculate: (−5) × (−9)', answer: '45', unit: '', explanation: '負 × 負 は正。5 × 9 = 45。', level: 4, category: '正負の数' },
  { id: 'm589', question: 'Calculate: (−20) ÷ 2', answer: '-10', unit: '', explanation: '負 ÷ 正 は負。20 ÷ 2 = 10 なので、答えは −10。', level: 4, category: '正負の数' },
  { id: 'm590', question: 'Calculate: (−17) + 2', answer: '-15', unit: '', explanation: '符号のちがう数の足し算は、絶対値の大きいほうから小さいほうを引き、大きいほうの符号をつける。答えは -15。', level: 4, category: '正負の数' },
  { id: 'm591', question: 'Calculate: 7 − (−13)', answer: '20', unit: '', explanation: '負の数を引くのは足すのと同じ。7 + 13 = 20。', level: 4, category: '正負の数' },
  { id: 'm592', question: 'Calculate: (−4) × (−11)', answer: '44', unit: '', explanation: '負 × 負 は正。4 × 11 = 44。', level: 4, category: '正負の数' },
  { id: 'm593', question: 'Calculate: (−40) ÷ 4', answer: '-10', unit: '', explanation: '負 ÷ 正 は負。40 ÷ 4 = 10 なので、答えは −10。', level: 4, category: '正負の数' },
  { id: 'm594', question: 'If x = 3, what is the value of 9x + 8?', answer: '35', unit: '', explanation: 'x に 3 を入れる。9 × 3 + 8 = 35。', level: 4, category: '文字式' },
  { id: 'm595', question: 'If x = −6, what is the value of 6x − 3?', answer: '-39', unit: '', explanation: '6 × (−6) = −36。そこから 3 を引いて -39。', level: 4, category: '文字式' },
  { id: 'm596', question: 'Simplify 9x + 6x, then find its value when x = 5.', answer: '75', unit: '', explanation: '同じ文字はまとめられる。9x + 6x = 15x。x = 5 を入れて 15 × 5 = 75。', level: 4, category: '文字式' },
  { id: 'm597', question: 'If x = 6, what is the value of 5(x + 8) − 4x?', answer: '46', unit: '', explanation: 'かっこを外して 5x + 40 − 4x = 1x + 40。x = 6 を入れて 46。', level: 4, category: '文字式' },
  { id: 'm598', question: 'If x = 2, what is the value of 5x + 5?', answer: '15', unit: '', explanation: 'x に 2 を入れる。5 × 2 + 5 = 15。', level: 4, category: '文字式' },
  { id: 'm599', question: 'If x = −6, what is the value of 3x − 6?', answer: '-24', unit: '', explanation: '3 × (−6) = −18。そこから 6 を引いて -24。', level: 4, category: '文字式' },
  { id: 'm600', question: 'Simplify 9x + 8x, then find its value when x = 4.', answer: '68', unit: '', explanation: '同じ文字はまとめられる。9x + 8x = 17x。x = 4 を入れて 17 × 4 = 68。', level: 4, category: '文字式' },
  { id: 'm601', question: 'If x = 6, what is the value of 4(x + 4) − 2x?', answer: '28', unit: '', explanation: 'かっこを外して 4x + 16 − 2x = 2x + 16。x = 6 を入れて 28。', level: 4, category: '文字式' },
  { id: 'm602', question: 'If x = 3, what is the value of 5x + 4?', answer: '19', unit: '', explanation: 'x に 3 を入れる。5 × 3 + 4 = 19。', level: 4, category: '文字式' },
  { id: 'm603', question: 'If x = −6, what is the value of 3x − 4?', answer: '-22', unit: '', explanation: '3 × (−6) = −18。そこから 4 を引いて -22。', level: 4, category: '文字式' },
  { id: 'm604', question: 'Simplify 3x + 4x, then find its value when x = 3.', answer: '21', unit: '', explanation: '同じ文字はまとめられる。3x + 4x = 7x。x = 3 を入れて 7 × 3 = 21。', level: 4, category: '文字式' },
  { id: 'm605', question: 'If x = 6, what is the value of 6(x + 9) − 5x?', answer: '60', unit: '', explanation: 'かっこを外して 6x + 54 − 5x = 1x + 54。x = 6 を入れて 60。', level: 4, category: '文字式' },
  { id: 'm606', question: 'If x = 5, what is the value of 9x + 4?', answer: '49', unit: '', explanation: 'x に 5 を入れる。9 × 5 + 4 = 49。', level: 4, category: '文字式' },
  { id: 'm607', question: 'If x = −2, what is the value of 4x − 5?', answer: '-13', unit: '', explanation: '4 × (−2) = −8。そこから 5 を引いて -13。', level: 4, category: '文字式' },
  { id: 'm608', question: 'Simplify 2x + 6x, then find its value when x = 4.', answer: '32', unit: '', explanation: '同じ文字はまとめられる。2x + 6x = 8x。x = 4 を入れて 8 × 4 = 32。', level: 4, category: '文字式' },
  { id: 'm609', question: 'If x = 5, what is the value of 6(x + 3) − 5x?', answer: '23', unit: '', explanation: 'かっこを外して 6x + 18 − 5x = 1x + 18。x = 5 を入れて 23。', level: 4, category: '文字式' },
  { id: 'm610', question: 'If x = 6, what is the value of 5x + 4?', answer: '34', unit: '', explanation: 'x に 6 を入れる。5 × 6 + 4 = 34。', level: 4, category: '文字式' },
  { id: 'm611', question: 'If x = −2, what is the value of 6x − 3?', answer: '-15', unit: '', explanation: '6 × (−2) = −12。そこから 3 を引いて -15。', level: 4, category: '文字式' },
  { id: 'm612', question: 'Solve for x: 5x + 3 = 18', answer: '3', unit: '', explanation: '両辺から 3 を引いて 5x = 15。5 で割って x = 3。', level: 4, category: '方程式' },
  { id: 'm613', question: 'Solve for x: 6x − 2 = 10', answer: '2', unit: '', explanation: '両辺に 2 を足して 6x = 12。6 で割って x = 2。', level: 4, category: '方程式' },
  { id: 'm614', question: 'Solve for x: 8x + 14 = 5x + 38', answer: '8', unit: '', explanation: '5x を左に移して 3x + 14 = 38。14 を右に移して 3x = 24。x = 8。', level: 4, category: '方程式' },
  { id: 'm615', question: 'Solve for x: 5(x + 3) = 60', answer: '9', unit: '', explanation: '両辺を 5 で割って x + 3 = 12。3 を引いて x = 9。', level: 4, category: '方程式' },
  { id: 'm616', question: 'Solve for x: 3x + 10 = 49', answer: '13', unit: '', explanation: '両辺から 10 を引いて 3x = 39。3 で割って x = 13。', level: 4, category: '方程式' },
  { id: 'm617', question: 'Solve for x: 5x − 16 = 39', answer: '11', unit: '', explanation: '両辺に 16 を足して 5x = 55。5 で割って x = 11。', level: 4, category: '方程式' },
  { id: 'm618', question: 'Solve for x: 3x + 5 = 2x + 7', answer: '2', unit: '', explanation: '2x を左に移して 1x + 5 = 7。5 を右に移して 1x = 2。x = 2。', level: 4, category: '方程式' },
  { id: 'm619', question: 'Solve for x: 5(x + 4) = 55', answer: '7', unit: '', explanation: '両辺を 5 で割って x + 4 = 11。4 を引いて x = 7。', level: 4, category: '方程式' },
  { id: 'm620', question: 'Solve for x: 3x + 11 = 44', answer: '11', unit: '', explanation: '両辺から 11 を引いて 3x = 33。3 で割って x = 11。', level: 4, category: '方程式' },
  { id: 'm621', question: 'Solve for x: 5x − 7 = 8', answer: '3', unit: '', explanation: '両辺に 7 を足して 5x = 15。5 で割って x = 3。', level: 4, category: '方程式' },
  { id: 'm622', question: 'Solve for x: 3x + 1 = 2x + 3', answer: '2', unit: '', explanation: '2x を左に移して 1x + 1 = 3。1 を右に移して 1x = 2。x = 2。', level: 4, category: '方程式' },
  { id: 'm623', question: 'Solve for x: 3(x + 9) = 57', answer: '10', unit: '', explanation: '両辺を 3 で割って x + 9 = 19。9 を引いて x = 10。', level: 4, category: '方程式' },
  { id: 'm624', question: 'Solve for x: 9x + 15 = 78', answer: '7', unit: '', explanation: '両辺から 15 を引いて 9x = 63。9 で割って x = 7。', level: 4, category: '方程式' },
  { id: 'm625', question: 'Solve for x: 5x − 7 = 38', answer: '9', unit: '', explanation: '両辺に 7 を足して 5x = 45。5 で割って x = 9。', level: 4, category: '方程式' },
  { id: 'm626', question: 'Solve for x: 5x + 8 = 2x + 20', answer: '4', unit: '', explanation: '2x を左に移して 3x + 8 = 20。8 を右に移して 3x = 12。x = 4。', level: 4, category: '方程式' },
  { id: 'm627', question: 'Solve for x: 2(x + 1) = 16', answer: '7', unit: '', explanation: '両辺を 2 で割って x + 1 = 8。1 を引いて x = 7。', level: 4, category: '方程式' },
  { id: 'm628', question: 'Solve for x: 2x + 12 = 24', answer: '6', unit: '', explanation: '両辺から 12 を引いて 2x = 12。2 で割って x = 6。', level: 4, category: '方程式' },
  { id: 'm629', question: 'Solve for x: 8x − 8 = 80', answer: '11', unit: '', explanation: '両辺に 8 を足して 8x = 88。8 で割って x = 11。', level: 4, category: '方程式' },
  { id: 'm630', question: 'Solve for x: 4x + 6 = 3x + 12', answer: '6', unit: '', explanation: '3x を左に移して 1x + 6 = 12。6 を右に移して 1x = 6。x = 6。', level: 4, category: '方程式' },
  { id: 'm631', question: 'Solve for x: 4(x + 4) = 56', answer: '10', unit: '', explanation: '両辺を 4 で割って x + 4 = 14。4 を引いて x = 10。', level: 4, category: '方程式' },
  { id: 'm632', question: 'y is proportional to x, and y = 40 when x = 5. What is y when x = 8?', answer: '64', unit: '', explanation: '比例なので y = ax。40 = a × 5 より a = 8。x = 8 のとき y = 8 × 8 = 64。', level: 4, category: '比例と反比例' },
  { id: 'm633', question: 'y is inversely proportional to x, and y = 4 when x = 6. What is y when x = 3?', answer: '8', unit: '', explanation: '反比例なので xy は一定。6 × 4 = 24。x = 3 のとき y = 24 ÷ 3 = 8。', level: 4, category: '比例と反比例' },
  { id: 'm634', question: 'A point (2, 4) is on the line y = ax. What is a?', answer: '2', unit: '', explanation: '4 = a × 2 なので a = 4 ÷ 2 = 2。', level: 4, category: '比例と反比例' },
  { id: 'm635', question: 'y is proportional to x, and y = 55 when x = 5. What is y when x = 8?', answer: '88', unit: '', explanation: '比例なので y = ax。55 = a × 5 より a = 11。x = 8 のとき y = 11 × 8 = 88。', level: 4, category: '比例と反比例' },
  { id: 'm636', question: 'y is inversely proportional to x, and y = 4 when x = 3. What is y when x = 2?', answer: '6', unit: '', explanation: '反比例なので xy は一定。3 × 4 = 12。x = 2 のとき y = 12 ÷ 2 = 6。', level: 4, category: '比例と反比例' },
  { id: 'm637', question: 'A point (7, 56) is on the line y = ax. What is a?', answer: '8', unit: '', explanation: '56 = a × 7 なので a = 56 ÷ 7 = 8。', level: 4, category: '比例と反比例' },
  { id: 'm638', question: 'y is proportional to x, and y = 20 when x = 5. What is y when x = 8?', answer: '32', unit: '', explanation: '比例なので y = ax。20 = a × 5 より a = 4。x = 8 のとき y = 4 × 8 = 32。', level: 4, category: '比例と反比例' },
  { id: 'm639', question: 'y is inversely proportional to x, and y = 12 when x = 3. What is y when x = 4?', answer: '9', unit: '', explanation: '反比例なので xy は一定。3 × 12 = 36。x = 4 のとき y = 36 ÷ 4 = 9。', level: 4, category: '比例と反比例' },
  { id: 'm640', question: 'A point (8, 40) is on the line y = ax. What is a?', answer: '5', unit: '', explanation: '40 = a × 8 なので a = 40 ÷ 8 = 5。', level: 4, category: '比例と反比例' },
  { id: 'm641', question: 'y is proportional to x, and y = 50 when x = 5. What is y when x = 8?', answer: '80', unit: '', explanation: '比例なので y = ax。50 = a × 5 より a = 10。x = 8 のとき y = 10 × 8 = 80。', level: 4, category: '比例と反比例' },
  { id: 'm642', question: 'y is inversely proportional to x, and y = 8 when x = 3. What is y when x = 2?', answer: '12', unit: '', explanation: '反比例なので xy は一定。3 × 8 = 24。x = 2 のとき y = 24 ÷ 2 = 12。', level: 4, category: '比例と反比例' },
  { id: 'm643', question: 'A point (8, 64) is on the line y = ax. What is a?', answer: '8', unit: '', explanation: '64 = a × 8 なので a = 64 ÷ 8 = 8。', level: 4, category: '比例と反比例' },
  { id: 'm644', question: 'y is proportional to x, and y = 90 when x = 9. What is y when x = 12?', answer: '120', unit: '', explanation: '比例なので y = ax。90 = a × 9 より a = 10。x = 12 のとき y = 10 × 12 = 120。', level: 4, category: '比例と反比例' },
  { id: 'm645', question: 'y is inversely proportional to x, and y = 18 when x = 2. What is y when x = 6?', answer: '6', unit: '', explanation: '反比例なので xy は一定。2 × 18 = 36。x = 6 のとき y = 36 ÷ 6 = 6。', level: 4, category: '比例と反比例' },
  { id: 'm646', question: 'A point (6, 30) is on the line y = ax. What is a?', answer: '5', unit: '', explanation: '30 = a × 6 なので a = 30 ÷ 6 = 5。', level: 4, category: '比例と反比例' },
  { id: 'm647', question: 'Two parallel lines are cut by a transversal. One angle is 35°. What is the co-interior (same-side interior) angle?', answer: '145', unit: '°', explanation: '平行線の同側内角の和は 180°。180 − 35 = 145°。', level: 4, category: '平面図形' },
  { id: 'm648', question: 'What is the sum of the interior angles of a polygon with 6 sides?', answer: '720', unit: '°', explanation: '内角の和 = (n − 2) × 180°。(6 − 2) × 180 = 720°。', level: 4, category: '平面図形' },
  { id: 'm649', question: 'What is the size of one interior angle of a regular polygon with 12 sides?', answer: '150', unit: '°', explanation: '内角の和は (12 − 2) × 180 = 1800°。正多角形なので 12 で割って 150°。', level: 4, category: '平面図形' },
  { id: 'm650', question: 'A sector has a radius of 2 cm and a central angle of 180°. What is its area? (Use 3.14)', answer: '6.28', unit: 'cm²', explanation: 'おうぎ形は円の 180/360 の部分。2 × 2 × 3.14 × 180/360 = 6.28 cm²。', level: 4, category: '平面図形' },
  { id: 'm651', question: 'Two parallel lines are cut by a transversal. One angle is 128°. What is the co-interior (same-side interior) angle?', answer: '52', unit: '°', explanation: '平行線の同側内角の和は 180°。180 − 128 = 52°。', level: 4, category: '平面図形' },
  { id: 'm652', question: 'What is the sum of the interior angles of a polygon with 12 sides?', answer: '1800', unit: '°', explanation: '内角の和 = (n − 2) × 180°。(12 − 2) × 180 = 1800°。', level: 4, category: '平面図形' },
  { id: 'm653', question: 'What is the size of one interior angle of a regular polygon with 10 sides?', answer: '144', unit: '°', explanation: '内角の和は (10 − 2) × 180 = 1440°。正多角形なので 10 で割って 144°。', level: 4, category: '平面図形' },
  { id: 'm654', question: 'A sector has a radius of 12 cm and a central angle of 120°. What is its area? (Use 3.14)', answer: '150.72', unit: 'cm²', explanation: 'おうぎ形は円の 120/360 の部分。12 × 12 × 3.14 × 120/360 = 150.72 cm²。', level: 4, category: '平面図形' },
  { id: 'm655', question: 'Two parallel lines are cut by a transversal. One angle is 55°. What is the co-interior (same-side interior) angle?', answer: '125', unit: '°', explanation: '平行線の同側内角の和は 180°。180 − 55 = 125°。', level: 4, category: '平面図形' },
  { id: 'm656', question: 'What is the sum of the interior angles of a polygon with 8 sides?', answer: '1080', unit: '°', explanation: '内角の和 = (n − 2) × 180°。(8 − 2) × 180 = 1080°。', level: 4, category: '平面図形' },
  { id: 'm657', question: 'What is the size of one interior angle of a regular polygon with 5 sides?', answer: '108', unit: '°', explanation: '内角の和は (5 − 2) × 180 = 540°。正多角形なので 5 で割って 108°。', level: 4, category: '平面図形' },
  { id: 'm658', question: 'A sector has a radius of 3 cm and a central angle of 45°. What is its area? (Use 3.14)', answer: '3.53', unit: 'cm²', explanation: 'おうぎ形は円の 45/360 の部分。3 × 3 × 3.14 × 45/360 = 3.53 cm²。', level: 4, category: '平面図形' },
  { id: 'm659', question: 'What is the size of one interior angle of a regular polygon with 6 sides?', answer: '120', unit: '°', explanation: '内角の和は (6 − 2) × 180 = 720°。正多角形なので 6 で割って 120°。', level: 4, category: '平面図形' },
  { id: 'm660', question: 'A sector has a radius of 5 cm and a central angle of 45°. What is its area? (Use 3.14)', answer: '9.81', unit: 'cm²', explanation: 'おうぎ形は円の 45/360 の部分。5 × 5 × 3.14 × 45/360 = 9.81 cm²。', level: 4, category: '平面図形' },
  { id: 'm661', question: 'Two parallel lines are cut by a transversal. One angle is 42°. What is the co-interior (same-side interior) angle?', answer: '138', unit: '°', explanation: '平行線の同側内角の和は 180°。180 − 42 = 138°。', level: 4, category: '平面図形' },
  { id: 'm662', question: 'What is the size of one interior angle of a regular polygon with 4 sides?', answer: '90', unit: '°', explanation: '内角の和は (4 − 2) × 180 = 360°。正多角形なので 4 で割って 90°。', level: 4, category: '平面図形' },
  { id: 'm663', question: 'A sector has a radius of 5 cm and a central angle of 90°. What is its area? (Use 3.14)', answer: '19.63', unit: 'cm²', explanation: 'おうぎ形は円の 90/360 の部分。5 × 5 × 3.14 × 90/360 = 19.63 cm²。', level: 4, category: '平面図形' },
  { id: 'm664', question: 'Two parallel lines are cut by a transversal. One angle is 115°. What is the co-interior (same-side interior) angle?', answer: '65', unit: '°', explanation: '平行線の同側内角の和は 180°。180 − 115 = 65°。', level: 4, category: '平面図形' },
  { id: 'm665', question: 'A rectangular box is 3 cm by 10 cm by 6 cm. What is its surface area?', answer: '216', unit: 'cm²', explanation: '向かい合う面が2枚ずつ。(3×10 + 10×6 + 3×6) × 2 = 216 cm²。', level: 4, category: '立体図形' },
  { id: 'm666', question: 'A cylinder has a radius of 9 cm and a height of 7 cm. What is its total surface area? (Use 3.14)', answer: '904.32', unit: 'cm²', explanation: '上下の円が 9 × 9 × 3.14 × 2 = 508.68 cm²。側面は 円周 × 高さ = 56.52 × 7 = 395.64 cm²。合わせて 904.32 cm²。', level: 4, category: '立体図形' },
  { id: 'm667', question: 'A pyramid has a square base with sides of 8 cm and a height of 6 cm. What is its volume?', answer: '128', unit: 'cm³', explanation: '角錐の体積 = 底面積 × 高さ ÷ 3 = 8 × 8 × 6 ÷ 3 = 128 cm³。', level: 4, category: '立体図形' },
  { id: 'm668', question: 'A rectangular box is 5 cm by 10 cm by 4 cm. What is its surface area?', answer: '220', unit: 'cm²', explanation: '向かい合う面が2枚ずつ。(5×10 + 10×4 + 5×4) × 2 = 220 cm²。', level: 4, category: '立体図形' },
  { id: 'm669', question: 'A cylinder has a radius of 6 cm and a height of 6 cm. What is its total surface area? (Use 3.14)', answer: '452.16', unit: 'cm²', explanation: '上下の円が 6 × 6 × 3.14 × 2 = 226.08 cm²。側面は 円周 × 高さ = 37.68 × 6 = 226.08 cm²。合わせて 452.16 cm²。', level: 4, category: '立体図形' },
  { id: 'm670', question: 'A pyramid has a square base with sides of 2 cm and a height of 12 cm. What is its volume?', answer: '16', unit: 'cm³', explanation: '角錐の体積 = 底面積 × 高さ ÷ 3 = 2 × 2 × 12 ÷ 3 = 16 cm³。', level: 4, category: '立体図形' },
  { id: 'm671', question: 'A rectangular box is 6 cm by 10 cm by 2 cm. What is its surface area?', answer: '184', unit: 'cm²', explanation: '向かい合う面が2枚ずつ。(6×10 + 10×2 + 6×2) × 2 = 184 cm²。', level: 4, category: '立体図形' },
  { id: 'm672', question: 'A cylinder has a radius of 9 cm and a height of 10 cm. What is its total surface area? (Use 3.14)', answer: '1073.88', unit: 'cm²', explanation: '上下の円が 9 × 9 × 3.14 × 2 = 508.68 cm²。側面は 円周 × 高さ = 56.52 × 10 = 565.2 cm²。合わせて 1073.88 cm²。', level: 4, category: '立体図形' },
  { id: 'm673', question: 'A pyramid has a square base with sides of 9 cm and a height of 9 cm. What is its volume?', answer: '243', unit: 'cm³', explanation: '角錐の体積 = 底面積 × 高さ ÷ 3 = 9 × 9 × 9 ÷ 3 = 243 cm³。', level: 4, category: '立体図形' },
  { id: 'm674', question: 'A rectangular box is 9 cm by 5 cm by 7 cm. What is its surface area?', answer: '286', unit: 'cm²', explanation: '向かい合う面が2枚ずつ。(9×5 + 5×7 + 9×7) × 2 = 286 cm²。', level: 4, category: '立体図形' },
  { id: 'm675', question: 'A cylinder has a radius of 6 cm and a height of 7 cm. What is its total surface area? (Use 3.14)', answer: '489.84', unit: 'cm²', explanation: '上下の円が 6 × 6 × 3.14 × 2 = 226.08 cm²。側面は 円周 × 高さ = 37.68 × 7 = 263.76 cm²。合わせて 489.84 cm²。', level: 4, category: '立体図形' },
  { id: 'm676', question: 'A cylinder has a radius of 6 cm and a height of 12 cm. What is its total surface area? (Use 3.14)', answer: '678.24', unit: 'cm²', explanation: '上下の円が 6 × 6 × 3.14 × 2 = 226.08 cm²。側面は 円周 × 高さ = 37.68 × 12 = 452.16 cm²。合わせて 678.24 cm²。', level: 4, category: '立体図形' },
  { id: 'm677', question: 'A pyramid has a square base with sides of 8 cm and a height of 21 cm. What is its volume?', answer: '448', unit: 'cm³', explanation: '角錐の体積 = 底面積 × 高さ ÷ 3 = 8 × 8 × 21 ÷ 3 = 448 cm³。', level: 4, category: '立体図形' },
  { id: 'm678', question: 'A rectangular box is 6 cm by 6 cm by 6 cm. What is its surface area?', answer: '216', unit: 'cm²', explanation: '向かい合う面が2枚ずつ。(6×6 + 6×6 + 6×6) × 2 = 216 cm²。', level: 4, category: '立体図形' },
  { id: 'm679', question: 'A cylinder has a radius of 4 cm and a height of 3 cm. What is its total surface area? (Use 3.14)', answer: '175.84', unit: 'cm²', explanation: '上下の円が 4 × 4 × 3.14 × 2 = 100.48 cm²。側面は 円周 × 高さ = 25.12 × 3 = 75.36 cm²。合わせて 175.84 cm²。', level: 4, category: '立体図形' },
  { id: 'm680', question: 'In a class of 40 students, 4 chose tennis. What is the relative frequency for tennis? Give the answer as a decimal.', answer: '0.1', unit: '', explanation: '相対度数 = 度数 ÷ 全体 = 4 ÷ 40 = 0.1。', level: 4, category: 'データの活用' },
  { id: 'm681', question: 'A bag has 3 red balls and 8 blue balls. One ball is taken at random. What is the probability it is red? Give the answer as a fraction (numerator/denominator) in simplest form.', answer: '3/11', unit: '', explanation: '全部で 11 個、うち赤は 3 個。3/11。', level: 4, category: 'データの活用' },
  { id: 'm682', question: 'A fair six-sided die is rolled. What is the probability of getting a multiple of 3? Give the answer as a fraction (numerator/denominator) in simplest form.', answer: '1/3', unit: '', explanation: 'あてはまる目は 3, 6 の 2 通り。全部で 6 通りなので 2/6 を約分して 1/3。', level: 4, category: 'データの活用' },
  { id: 'm683', question: 'Find the median of: 26, 13, 5, 6, 12, 22.', answer: '12.5', unit: '', explanation: '小さい順に並べると 5, 6, 12, 13, 22, 26。個数が偶数なので真ん中2つ 12 と 13 の平均をとって 12.5。', level: 4, category: 'データの活用' },
  { id: 'm684', question: 'In a class of 25 students, 5 chose tennis. What is the relative frequency for tennis? Give the answer as a decimal.', answer: '0.2', unit: '', explanation: '相対度数 = 度数 ÷ 全体 = 5 ÷ 25 = 0.2。', level: 4, category: 'データの活用' },
  { id: 'm685', question: 'A bag has 7 red balls and 6 blue balls. One ball is taken at random. What is the probability it is red? Give the answer as a fraction (numerator/denominator) in simplest form.', answer: '7/13', unit: '', explanation: '全部で 13 個、うち赤は 7 個。7/13。', level: 4, category: 'データの活用' },
  { id: 'm686', question: 'A fair six-sided die is rolled. What is the probability of getting a number greater than 4? Give the answer as a fraction (numerator/denominator) in simplest form.', answer: '1/3', unit: '', explanation: 'あてはまる目は 5, 6 の 2 通り。全部で 6 通りなので 2/6 を約分して 1/3。', level: 4, category: 'データの活用' },
  { id: 'm687', question: 'Find the median of: 29, 13, 22, 16, 28, 14, 15, 15.', answer: '15.5', unit: '', explanation: '小さい順に並べると 13, 14, 15, 15, 16, 22, 28, 29。個数が偶数なので真ん中2つ 15 と 16 の平均をとって 15.5。', level: 4, category: 'データの活用' },
  { id: 'm688', question: 'A bag has 6 red balls and 6 blue balls. One ball is taken at random. What is the probability it is red? Give the answer as a fraction (numerator/denominator) in simplest form.', answer: '1/2', unit: '', explanation: '全部で 12 個、うち赤は 6 個。6/12 を約分して 1/2。', level: 4, category: 'データの活用' },
  { id: 'm689', question: 'A fair six-sided die is rolled. What is the probability of getting an even number? Give the answer as a fraction (numerator/denominator) in simplest form.', answer: '1/2', unit: '', explanation: 'あてはまる目は 2, 4, 6 の 3 通り。全部で 6 通りなので 3/6 を約分して 1/2。', level: 4, category: 'データの活用' },
  { id: 'm690', question: 'Find the median of: 19, 25, 20, 15, 27, 17, 21, 15.', answer: '19.5', unit: '', explanation: '小さい順に並べると 15, 15, 17, 19, 20, 21, 25, 27。個数が偶数なので真ん中2つ 19 と 20 の平均をとって 19.5。', level: 4, category: 'データの活用' },
  { id: 'm691', question: 'In a class of 20 students, 8 chose tennis. What is the relative frequency for tennis? Give the answer as a decimal.', answer: '0.4', unit: '', explanation: '相対度数 = 度数 ÷ 全体 = 8 ÷ 20 = 0.4。', level: 4, category: 'データの活用' },
  { id: 'm692', question: 'A bag has 4 red balls and 3 blue balls. One ball is taken at random. What is the probability it is red? Give the answer as a fraction (numerator/denominator) in simplest form.', answer: '4/7', unit: '', explanation: '全部で 7 個、うち赤は 4 個。4/7。', level: 4, category: 'データの活用' },
  { id: 'm693', question: 'Find the median of: 22, 2, 26, 22, 25, 30.', answer: '23.5', unit: '', explanation: '小さい順に並べると 2, 22, 22, 25, 26, 30。個数が偶数なので真ん中2つ 22 と 25 の平均をとって 23.5。', level: 4, category: 'データの活用' },
  { id: 'm694', question: 'In a class of 50 students, 10 chose tennis. What is the relative frequency for tennis? Give the answer as a decimal.', answer: '0.2', unit: '', explanation: '相対度数 = 度数 ÷ 全体 = 10 ÷ 50 = 0.2。', level: 4, category: 'データの活用' },
  { id: 'm695', question: 'Find the median of: 27, 29, 3, 18, 2, 8, 26, 10, 11, 14.', answer: '12.5', unit: '', explanation: '小さい順に並べると 2, 3, 8, 10, 11, 14, 18, 26, 27, 29。個数が偶数なので真ん中2つ 11 と 14 の平均をとって 12.5。', level: 4, category: 'データの活用' },
  { id: 'm696', question: 'In a class of 40 students, 8 chose tennis. What is the relative frequency for tennis? Give the answer as a decimal.', answer: '0.2', unit: '', explanation: '相対度数 = 度数 ÷ 全体 = 8 ÷ 40 = 0.2。', level: 4, category: 'データの活用' },
  { id: 'm697', question: 'A bag has 4 red balls and 4 blue balls. One ball is taken at random. What is the probability it is red? Give the answer as a fraction (numerator/denominator) in simplest form.', answer: '1/2', unit: '', explanation: '全部で 8 個、うち赤は 4 個。4/8 を約分して 1/2。', level: 4, category: 'データの活用' },
  { id: 'm698', question: 'Solve: 8x + 11 > 59. The answer has the form x > k. What is k?', answer: '6', unit: '', explanation: '両辺から 11 を引いて 8x > 48。正の数 8 で割るので不等号の向きは変わらず x > 6。k = 6。', level: 4, category: '不等式' },
  { id: 'm699', question: 'Solve: −5x + 15 < -30. The answer has the form x > k. What is k?', answer: '9', unit: '', explanation: '15 を移項して −5x < -45。負の数 −5 で割るので不等号の向きが変わり x > 9。k = 9。', level: 4, category: '不等式' },
  { id: 'm700', question: 'Notebooks cost 200 yen each. With 1661 yen, what is the greatest number you can buy?', answer: '8', unit: '冊', explanation: '200x ≦ 1661 を解くと x ≦ 8.31。冊数は整数なので最大 8 冊。', level: 4, category: '不等式' },
  { id: 'm701', question: 'Solve: 8x + 5 > 53. The answer has the form x > k. What is k?', answer: '6', unit: '', explanation: '両辺から 5 を引いて 8x > 48。正の数 8 で割るので不等号の向きは変わらず x > 6。k = 6。', level: 4, category: '不等式' },
  { id: 'm702', question: 'Solve: −7x + 12 < -23. The answer has the form x > k. What is k?', answer: '5', unit: '', explanation: '12 を移項して −7x < -35。負の数 −7 で割るので不等号の向きが変わり x > 5。k = 5。', level: 4, category: '不等式' },
  { id: 'm703', question: 'Notebooks cost 700 yen each. With 4181 yen, what is the greatest number you can buy?', answer: '5', unit: '冊', explanation: '700x ≦ 4181 を解くと x ≦ 5.97。冊数は整数なので最大 5 冊。', level: 4, category: '不等式' },
  { id: 'm704', question: 'Solve: 4x + 14 > 34. The answer has the form x > k. What is k?', answer: '5', unit: '', explanation: '両辺から 14 を引いて 4x > 20。正の数 4 で割るので不等号の向きは変わらず x > 5。k = 5。', level: 4, category: '不等式' },
  { id: 'm705', question: 'Solve: −7x + 14 < 0. The answer has the form x > k. What is k?', answer: '2', unit: '', explanation: '14 を移項して −7x < -14。負の数 −7 で割るので不等号の向きが変わり x > 2。k = 2。', level: 4, category: '不等式' },
  { id: 'm706', question: 'Notebooks cost 700 yen each. With 2608 yen, what is the greatest number you can buy?', answer: '3', unit: '冊', explanation: '700x ≦ 2608 を解くと x ≦ 3.73。冊数は整数なので最大 3 冊。', level: 4, category: '不等式' },
  { id: 'm707', question: 'Solve: 2x + 14 > 34. The answer has the form x > k. What is k?', answer: '10', unit: '', explanation: '両辺から 14 を引いて 2x > 20。正の数 2 で割るので不等号の向きは変わらず x > 10。k = 10。', level: 4, category: '不等式' },
  { id: 'm708', question: 'Solve: −5x + 7 < -23. The answer has the form x > k. What is k?', answer: '6', unit: '', explanation: '7 を移項して −5x < -30。負の数 −5 で割るので不等号の向きが変わり x > 6。k = 6。', level: 4, category: '不等式' },
  { id: 'm709', question: 'Notebooks cost 200 yen each. With 1326 yen, what is the greatest number you can buy?', answer: '6', unit: '冊', explanation: '200x ≦ 1326 を解くと x ≦ 6.63。冊数は整数なので最大 6 冊。', level: 4, category: '不等式' },
  { id: 'm710', question: 'Solve: 5x + 4 > 34. The answer has the form x > k. What is k?', answer: '6', unit: '', explanation: '両辺から 4 を引いて 5x > 30。正の数 5 で割るので不等号の向きは変わらず x > 6。k = 6。', level: 4, category: '不等式' },
  { id: 'm711', question: 'Solve: −5x + 4 < -41. The answer has the form x > k. What is k?', answer: '9', unit: '', explanation: '4 を移項して −5x < -45。負の数 −5 で割るので不等号の向きが変わり x > 9。k = 9。', level: 4, category: '不等式' },
  { id: 'm712', question: 'Notebooks cost 900 yen each. With 8756 yen, what is the greatest number you can buy?', answer: '9', unit: '冊', explanation: '900x ≦ 8756 を解くと x ≦ 9.73。冊数は整数なので最大 9 冊。', level: 4, category: '不等式' },
  { id: 'm713', question: 'Tom has 8 more marbles than Sam. Together they have 58 marbles. How many does Sam have?', answer: '25', unit: '個', explanation: 'サムを x とすると Tom は x + 8。x + (x + 8) = 58。2x = 50 なので x = 25 個。', level: 4, category: '方程式' },
  { id: 'm714', question: 'A number multiplied by 3 and then increased by 6 gives 63. What is the number?', answer: '19', unit: '', explanation: 'もとの数を x とすると 3x + 6 = 63。6 を移項して 3x = 57。3 で割って x = 19。', level: 4, category: '方程式' },
  { id: 'm715', question: 'A rectangle is 5 cm longer than it is wide. Its perimeter is 54 cm. What is its width?', answer: '11', unit: 'cm', explanation: 'よこを x とすると たては x + 5。周は 2(x + x + 5) = 54。4x = 44 なので x = 11 cm。', level: 4, category: '方程式' },
  { id: 'm716', question: 'Tom is 12 years old. In 8 years, Tom\'s parent will be 2 times as old as Tom. How old is the parent now?', answer: '32', unit: '歳', explanation: '8 年後、Tom は 20 歳。親はその 2 倍で 40 歳。いまは 40 − 8 = 32 歳。', level: 4, category: '方程式' },
  { id: 'm717', question: 'Tom has 13 more marbles than Sam. Together they have 43 marbles. How many does Sam have?', answer: '15', unit: '個', explanation: 'サムを x とすると Tom は x + 13。x + (x + 13) = 43。2x = 30 なので x = 15 個。', level: 4, category: '方程式' },
  { id: 'm718', question: 'A number multiplied by 4 and then increased by 8 gives 60. What is the number?', answer: '13', unit: '', explanation: 'もとの数を x とすると 4x + 8 = 60。8 を移項して 4x = 52。4 で割って x = 13。', level: 4, category: '方程式' },
  { id: 'm719', question: 'A rectangle is 4 cm longer than it is wide. Its perimeter is 24 cm. What is its width?', answer: '4', unit: 'cm', explanation: 'よこを x とすると たては x + 4。周は 2(x + x + 4) = 24。4x = 16 なので x = 4 cm。', level: 4, category: '方程式' },
  { id: 'm720', question: 'Leo is 13 years old. In 5 years, Leo\'s parent will be 3 times as old as Leo. How old is the parent now?', answer: '49', unit: '歳', explanation: '5 年後、Leo は 18 歳。親はその 3 倍で 54 歳。いまは 54 − 5 = 49 歳。', level: 4, category: '方程式' },
  { id: 'm721', question: 'Leo has 12 more marbles than Sam. Together they have 38 marbles. How many does Sam have?', answer: '13', unit: '個', explanation: 'サムを x とすると Leo は x + 12。x + (x + 12) = 38。2x = 26 なので x = 13 個。', level: 4, category: '方程式' },
  { id: 'm722', question: 'A number multiplied by 2 and then increased by 4 gives 18. What is the number?', answer: '7', unit: '', explanation: 'もとの数を x とすると 2x + 4 = 18。4 を移項して 2x = 14。2 で割って x = 7。', level: 4, category: '方程式' },
  { id: 'm723', question: 'A rectangle is 3 cm longer than it is wide. Its perimeter is 34 cm. What is its width?', answer: '7', unit: 'cm', explanation: 'よこを x とすると たては x + 3。周は 2(x + x + 3) = 34。4x = 28 なので x = 7 cm。', level: 4, category: '方程式' },
  { id: 'm724', question: 'Emma is 8 years old. In 2 years, Emma\'s parent will be 3 times as old as Emma. How old is the parent now?', answer: '28', unit: '歳', explanation: '2 年後、Emma は 10 歳。親はその 3 倍で 30 歳。いまは 30 − 2 = 28 歳。', level: 4, category: '方程式' },
  { id: 'm725', question: 'Mina has 11 more marbles than Sam. Together they have 91 marbles. How many does Sam have?', answer: '40', unit: '個', explanation: 'サムを x とすると Mina は x + 11。x + (x + 11) = 91。2x = 80 なので x = 40 個。', level: 4, category: '方程式' },
  { id: 'm726', question: 'A number multiplied by 5 and then increased by 10 gives 35. What is the number?', answer: '5', unit: '', explanation: 'もとの数を x とすると 5x + 10 = 35。10 を移項して 5x = 25。5 で割って x = 5。', level: 4, category: '方程式' },
  { id: 'm727', question: 'A rectangle is 5 cm longer than it is wide. Its perimeter is 50 cm. What is its width?', answer: '10', unit: 'cm', explanation: 'よこを x とすると たては x + 5。周は 2(x + x + 5) = 50。4x = 40 なので x = 10 cm。', level: 4, category: '方程式' },
  { id: 'm728', question: 'Anna is 9 years old. In 4 years, Anna\'s parent will be 3 times as old as Anna. How old is the parent now?', answer: '35', unit: '歳', explanation: '4 年後、Anna は 13 歳。親はその 3 倍で 39 歳。いまは 39 − 4 = 35 歳。', level: 4, category: '方程式' }
